---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
import BottomNav from '../components/BottomNav.astro'
import BackButton from '../components/BackButton.astro'
import { CATEGORIAS } from '../utils/constants'
import CiudadAutocomplete from '../components/CiudadAutocomplete.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Mi CV | Búsqueda Laboral"
  description="Creá y gestioná tu CV para que te encuentren comercios de tu localidad."
>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-8 pb-12 flex flex-col min-h-dvh justify-between">
    <div class="loading-screen" id="loading-screen">
      <div class="splash-content">
        <img src="/logo.webp" alt="Búsqueda Laboral" class="splash-logo" />
        <h1 class="splash-title">Búsqueda Laboral</h1>
        <div class="loading-spinner splash-spinner"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full hidden" id="contenido-cv">
      <div class="pb-4 mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide" style="color: var(--primary)">
              Mi CV
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xs mt-1" style="color: var(--tertiary)">
              Búsqueda Laboral — conectá con comercios de tu localidad.
            </p>
          </div>
          <BackButton href="/" label="Ver la cartelera" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-16 h-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/40 mt-2"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-2 mb-5" role="tablist">
        <button
          id="tab-micv"
          type="button"
          class="flex-1 py-2.5 min-h-[44px] rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-colors cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
          style="background: #f59e0b; color: #ffffff"
        >
          Mi CV
        </button>
        <button
          id="tab-ejemplo"
          type="button"
          class="flex-1 py-2.5 min-h-[44px] rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-colors cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
          style="background: var(--elevated); color: var(--tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
        >
          Ver ejemplo
        </button>
      </div>

      <div id="pestana-micv">
        <div
          id="alerta-success"
          class="hidden mb-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border text-sm font-semibold"
          style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35); color: #10b981"
        >
          <span id="alerta-success-texto">¡CV guardado!</span>
        </div>
        <div
          id="alerta-error"
          class="hidden mb-4 p-4 rounded-2xl border text-sm font-semibold"
          style="background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12); border-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.35); color: #ef4444"
        >
          <span id="alerta-error-texto">Ocurrió un error.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-3xl" style="background: var(--elevated)">
          <p class="text-xs mb-5 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tertiary)">
            Publicá tu CV para que los comercios de tu localidad te encuentren. Al conseguir
            trabajo, lo sacás de la cartelera.
          </p>

          <div
            id="cv-sin-datos"
            class="text-center py-8 px-4 rounded-2xl"
            style="background: var(--surface)"
          >
            <span class="text-4xl block mb-3" aria-hidden="true">
              🧑‍💼
            </span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold mb-4" style="color: var(--primary)">
              Todavía no publicaste tu CV.
            </p>
            <button
              id="btn-crear-cv"
              type="button"
              class="px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
              style="background: #f59e0b; color: #ffffff"
            >
              Crear mi CV
            </button>
          </div>

          <div id="cv-preview" class="hidden">
            <div class="flex gap-2 mb-3" data-formato-control>
              <button
                type="button"
                data-formato="clasico"
                class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
              >
                Clásico
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                data-formato="moderno"
                class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
              >
                Moderno
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                data-formato="compacto"
                class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
              >
                Compacto
              </button>
            </div>
            <div
              id="cv-preview-card"
              class="p-5 rounded-3xl mb-4"
              style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
            ></div>
            <div
              id="cv-oculto-aviso"
              class="hidden p-4 rounded-2xl mb-4 text-sm"
              style="background: #f59e0b10; border: 1px solid #f59e0b30; color: #92400e"
            >
              <p class="font-semibold">Tu CV está oculto</p>
              <p class="mt-1">
                No aparece en la cartelera pero lo tenés guardado. Si volvés a buscar trabajo,
                publicalo de nuevo.
              </p>
            </div>
            <button
              id="btn-toggle-cv"
              type="button"
              class="w-full py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer touch-manipulation flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
              style="background: #f59e0b; color: #ffffff"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"
                ></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
              <span id="texto-toggle-cv">Quitar de la cartelera</span>
            </button>
            <div class="flex gap-3 mt-3">
              <button
                id="btn-editar-cv"
                type="button"
                class="flex-1 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                style="background: var(--elevated); color: var(--secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-7"
                  ></path>
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 013 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                Editar
              </button>
              <button
                id="btn-eliminar-cv"
                type="button"
                class="flex-1 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                style="background: var(--elevated); color: #ef4444; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <polyline points="3 6 5 6 21 6"></polyline>
                  <path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 01-2 2H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"></path>
                </svg>
                Eliminar
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-3 mt-3">
              <button
                id="btn-compartir-cv"
                type="button"
                class="flex-1 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer touch-manipulation flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                style="background: var(--elevated); color: var(--secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle>
                  <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                  <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle>
                  <line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"></line>
                  <line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"></line>
                </svg>
                Compartir
              </button>
              <button
                id="btn-descargar-cv"
                type="button"
                class="flex-1 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer touch-manipulation flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                style="background: var(--elevated); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              >
                <span
                  id="spinner-pdf"
                  class="hidden w-4 h-4 border-2 border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"
                  style="border-color: var(--primary); border-top-color: transparent"
                ></span>
                <svg
                  class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"></path>
                  <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                  <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                </svg>
                <span id="texto-pdf">Descargar PDF</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <form
            id="form-cv"
            class="hidden space-y-4 p-4 rounded-2xl"
            style="background: var(--surface)"
          >
            <p id="form-cv-titulo" class="text-xs font-bold" style="color: var(--secondary)">
              Nuevo CV:
            </p>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-nombre"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Nombre completo *
              </label>
              <input
                id="cv-nombre"
                type="text"
                maxlength="80"
                placeholder="Ej: Juan López"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-ciudad-input"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Ciudad o localidad *
              </label>
              <CiudadAutocomplete
                inputId="cv-ciudad-input"
                hiddenName="cv-ciudad"
                placeholder="Busca tu localidad..."
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-rubro"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Conocimientos (opcional — recomendable)
              </label>
              <select
                id="cv-rubro"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none appearance-none"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              >
                <option value="">Elegí tus conocimientos (opcional — recomendable)</option>
                {CATEGORIAS.map((cat) => (
                  <option value={cat.value}>{cat.label}</option>
                ))}
              </select>
              <p class="text-[10px] mt-1" style="color: var(--tertiary)">
                No se muestra en tu CV. Lo usamos solo para conectarte con comercios (filtro de la
                cartelera y match futuro).
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-sobre-mi"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Sobre mí (opcional)
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="cv-sobre-mi"
                rows="3"
                maxlength="300"
                placeholder="Ej: Soy una persona proactiva con buena predisposición a trabajar en equipo."
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors resize-none"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              ></textarea>
              <p
                id="cv-sobre-mi-contador"
                class="text-[10px] mt-1.5 text-right"
                style="color: var(--tertiary)"
                aria-live="off"
              >
                0/300
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-habilidades"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Habilidades (opcional)
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="cv-habilidades"
                rows="2"
                maxlength="300"
                placeholder="Ej: manejo de caja, atención al cliente, cocina..."
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors resize-none"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-experiencia"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Experiencia (opcional)
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="cv-experiencia"
                rows="2"
                maxlength="300"
                placeholder="Ej: 2 años en gastronomía..."
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors resize-none"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-disponibilidad"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Disponibilidad (opcional)
              </label>
              <input
                id="cv-disponibilidad"
                type="text"
                maxlength="60"
                placeholder="Ej: full time, fines de semana, mañanas"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-whatsapp"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                WhatsApp de contacto *
              </label>
              <input
                id="cv-whatsapp"
                type="tel"
                inputmode="numeric"
                maxlength="20"
                placeholder="Ej: 5491155555555"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-email"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Email (opcional)
              </label>
              <input
                id="cv-email"
                type="email"
                maxlength="80"
                placeholder="Ej: juan@gmail.com"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-direccion"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Dirección (opcional)
              </label>
              <input
                id="cv-direccion"
                type="text"
                maxlength="100"
                placeholder="Ej: Av. Principal 1234"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div>
                <label
                  for="cv-nivel-estudios"
                  class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                  style="color: var(--secondary)"
                >
                  Nivel de estudios (opcional)
                </label>
                <select
                  id="cv-nivel-estudios"
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none appearance-none"
                  style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
                >
                  <option value="">Elegí</option>
                  <option value="Secundario incompleto">Secundario incompleto</option>
                  <option value="Secundario completo">Secundario completo</option>
                  <option value="Terciario en curso">Terciario en curso</option>
                  <option value="Terciario completo">Terciario completo</option>
                  <option value="Universitario en curso">Universitario en curso</option>
                  <option value="Universitario completo">Universitario completo</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label
                  for="cv-movilidad"
                  class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                  style="color: var(--secondary)"
                >
                  Movilidad propia (opcional)
                </label>
                <select
                  id="cv-movilidad"
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none appearance-none"
                  style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
                >
                  <option value="">Elegí</option>
                  <option value="No">No</option>
                  <option value="Bicicleta">Bicicleta</option>
                  <option value="Moto">Moto</option>
                  <option value="Auto">Auto</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label
                for="cv-idiomas"
                class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5"
                style="color: var(--secondary)"
              >
                Idiomas (opcional)
              </label>
              <input
                id="cv-idiomas"
                type="text"
                maxlength="80"
                placeholder="Ej: Inglés intermedio, Portugués básico"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors"
                style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold mb-1.5" style="color: var(--secondary)">
                Foto (opcional)
              </p>
              <input id="cv-foto" type="file" accept="image/*" class="hidden" />
              <button
                type="button"
                id="btn-cv-foto"
                class="w-full py-3 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold transition-all active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
                style="background: var(--elevated); color: var(--secondary); border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong)"
              >
                Subir foto
              </button>
              <div id="cv-foto-preview" class="hidden mt-3 flex items-center gap-4">
                <div
                  id="cv-foto-encuadre"
                  class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0 has-[:focus-visible]:ring-2 has-[:focus-visible]:ring-[#f59e0b]"
                  style="border: 2px solid var(--border-strong); cursor: grab"
                >
                  <img
                    id="cv-foto-img"
                    tabindex="0"
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover focus:outline-none"
                    alt="Foto del CV. Arrastrá o usá las flechas del teclado para elegir el encuadre."
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                  <p
                    id="cv-foto-encuadre-ayuda"
                    class="text-[10px] leading-relaxed"
                    style="color: var(--tertiary)"
                  >
                    Arrastrá la foto para elegir cómo queda el encuadre.
                  </p>
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mt-2">
                    <button
                      type="button"
                      id="btn-cv-foto-centrar"
                      class="text-xs font-bold underline cursor-pointer"
                      style="color: var(--secondary)"
                    >
                      Centrar
                    </button>
                    <button
                      type="button"
                      id="btn-cv-foto-quitar"
                      class="text-xs font-bold underline cursor-pointer"
                      style="color: #ef4444"
                    >
                      Quitar foto
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p id="cv-foto-encuadre-aviso" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold mb-1.5" style="color: var(--secondary)">
                Plantilla del CV
              </label>
              <div class="flex gap-2" data-formato-control>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-formato="clasico"
                  class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
                >
                  Clásico
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-formato="moderno"
                  class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
                >
                  Moderno
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-formato="compacto"
                  class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
                >
                  Compacto
                </button>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[10px] mt-1" style="color: var(--tertiary)">
                Cambia cómo se ve tu CV cuando alguien lo abre. Aplica también al PDF.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-3 pt-2">
              <button
                type="submit"
                class="flex-1 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
                style="background: #f59e0b; color: #ffffff"
              >
                Guardar CV
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                id="btn-cancelar-cv"
                class="px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer touch-manipulation"
                style="background: var(--elevated); color: var(--secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
              >
                Cancelar
              </button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="pestana-ejemplo" class="hidden">
        <div
          class="p-5 rounded-3xl"
          style="background: var(--elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
        >
          <p class="text-xs mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--tertiary)">
            Este es un ejemplo de cómo podés armar tu CV. Usalo como guía, no como modelo rígido: lo
            importante es que se vea claro, sea honesto y cuente qué sabés hacer. El tuyo se muestra
            igual en la cartelera.
          </p>
          <div
            class="p-5 rounded-3xl"
            style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f59e0b1a, transparent 120px), var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong)"
          >
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
              <div class="rounded-full p-0.5 shrink-0" style="border: 2px solid #f59e0b">
                <div
                  class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl"
